    "enUS": {
      "description": "Greetings traveller!\r\n\r\nIf yer lookin' for a place to hang yer hat, look no further than Berdun's travel lodge! The tent's in a bit o' disrepair right now, but that can be remedied.\r\n\r\nTell ye what. If ye get me what I need to fix the tent, I'll let ye stay here for free. How's that sound?\r\n\r\nI'll need some mosshoof hides. The easiest to hunt mosshooves are just north o' here, but the hide of any mooshoof will do.",
      "dialogue": {
        "d46f5e269012a8f9812f": "Got the supplies yet?",
        "f5d20445e48f9c704d89": "Nicely done, friend! I'll fix this place up right away. Kick up yer feet and take a load off!"
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Mosshoof Hide",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Bring 5 Mosshoof Hides to Berdun Cliffbrew at Talrendis Point in Azshara.",
      "title": "Home on the Range",
